OL,3,ANew York City building collapse kills
OL,4,Aseveral people
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral people have died after a New
OL,7,FYork City building containing
OL,8,Fapartments collapsed into a
OL,9,Fneighbouring open construction site on
OL,10,FWednesday afternoon.
OL,12,FMore than a dozen others are injured,
OL,13,Fand some of them are in a critical
OL,14,Fcondition, according to the BBC's US
OL,15,Fpartner CBS News, which cited local
OL,16,Fofficials.
OL,18,FThe collapse sparked a massive
OL,19,Fsearch-and-rescue operation, with more
OL,20,Fthan 250 first responders going to the
OL,21,Fscene of the fallen three-storey
OL,22,Fbuilding in Brooklyn.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
